# ReXGlue SDK changes for WWE 2K14 (session59): 0ef0000aad71..e03ea01780e4 on wwe2k14-local
# Apply in order on upstream rexglue/rexglue-sdk f5337cd (git apply). Commits (first parent):
#  e03ea01 Session 59 review fixes (medium items): native storage views for k_8 on R8 host formats only (k_4_4_4_4's B4G4R4A4 has no storage image support); the 1x and scaled k_8 / k_4_4_4_4 direct copies swap endianness as the stock 8 / 16bpp copies (k_8 never, k_4_4_4_4 only 8-in-16); the 1x texture write not after a fill and only with the extended storage formats
#  7caf05b Session 59 medium item c: gpu_native_truth_direct_resolve_scaled_small (k_8 / k_4_4_4_4 copies at a resolution scale straight into the scaled buffer, the stock 8-texel unit layout); gpu_native_truth_direct_resolve_depth at a resolution scale too (FULL_DEPTH); all off
#  b463cfb Session 59 medium items: gpu_native_truth_fill_direct_small (k_8 / k_4_4_4_4 fills through R8_UINT / R16_UINT views), gpu_native_truth_fill_direct_depth (depth fills through the R32_UINT view), gpu_native_truth_direct_resolve_depth (1x depth copies straight from the depth image), all off
#  4c91865 wwe2k14 Session 59: shaderStorageImageExtendedFormats enabled when supported; vulkan_texture_native_storage_small (off): 1x k_8 / k_4_4_4_4 textures without mips get R8_UINT / R16_UINT storage views; gpu_native_truth_direct_resolve_full_1x_texture (off): the 1x full copy writes that texture too (no fill)
#  a2a4be4 wwe2k14 Session 59 (diagnostic): wide resolves in the readback windows logged, read back or not ([s59][readback])
#  34e87e8 wwe2k14 Session 59 (diagnostic): vulkan_debug_skip_draw_read_barrier - the ceiling of range-aware shared-memory read barriers
#  d285d44 wwe2k14 Session 59 (diagnostic): gpu_debug_draw_census_vs / _count - [s59][drawcensus] per draw of one vertex shader: dirty bits, index base / count, fetch-constant hash
#  cf6b943 wwe2k14 Session 59 step 1d: gpu_native_truth_direct_resolve_full_1x (off) - full k_8 / k_4_4_4_4 copies at 1x straight from the RGBA8 truth image into memory (no staging stores, no stock copy; overlapping texture-only records materialized first)
#  35317cc wwe2k14 Session 59 (diagnostic): gpu_native_truth_debug_skip_staged_resolves - the staged resolves' ceiling (plan step 1d)
#  d78b62a wwe2k14 Session 59 step 1b: the texture write found by the texture's own base and written at the copy's place in it (atlas parts: copy_dest_base_x / y; two push constants more for the texture variant)
#  b7be252 wwe2k14 Session 59 step 4b: vulkan_uniform_pool_mirror (off, restart) - draw constants written to system memory pages, each with a device-local mirror the descriptors use; the ranges flushed at the submission end are copied host -> mirror in the hoist stream (first in the submission)
#  063a235 wwe2k14 Session 59 (review fixes, the rest of dfa7bd1's list): a restored lean base needs the same primitive and major mode and ends the repeat run (repeat_prev_ invalid); clear-only resolves do not count in the readback destination history, which is pruned once a frame
#  dfa7bd1 wwe2k14 Session 59: step 1b gpu_native_truth_direct_resolve_scaled_full_texture (off) - the full k_16_16 / k_16_16_16_16 copies at a scale also write their scaled texture; review fixes: a restored lean base needs the same primitive / major mode and ends the repeat run; a texture leaving the storage-write usage (reload, swap sample, another write) flushes the deferred native work first; clear-only resolves do not count in the readback history, pruned once a frame
#  ea2c3d4 wwe2k14 Session 59 step 4a: gpu_native_lean_multi_base (off) - this frame's last 16 lean bases kept by render state; a draw with no base or with render state written goes lean on an earlier base of exactly its render state and shaders (no packet / outside write since); samplers redone after a restore
#  9eabc51 wwe2k14 Session 59 (review of step 1c): a fill that is not deferred flushes the batch before its texture barrier; one that meets an earlier batched write of its texture flushes with its own barrier still held, then records it before its dispatch
#  51981db wwe2k14 Session 59: deferred fills share a batch when their texture rectangles do not overlap (one texture barrier per texture); vulkan_constants_reuse_identical (off): a constant buffer equal to the last written of its kind this frame reuses that copy; census [s59][lean multi] (with gpu_native_lean_dirty_census)
#  aff1c4d wwe2k14 Session 59 step 1c: gpu_native_truth_batch_fills (off) - truth texture fills into a storage view deferred into the texture-only resolve batch (held texture barrier; flush binds per-entry set count / push size); diagnostic gpu_native_truth_debug_skip_alias (step 3 ceiling)
#  32e3efd wwe2k14 Session 59: readback_resolve_override_skip_recurring (the app's readback windows skip the frame's recurring resolves; one-off resolves still read back) + diagnostic vulkan_debug_skip_constants_rebind
#  7db8410 wwe2k14 Session 59 step 1a: gpu_native_truth_defer_dest_use_scaled (off) - at a resolution scale a truth resolve's scaled-buffer write use is held until a dispatch writes the buffer (texture-only scaled resolves: none, so the truth passes around them keep their lazy chain)
#  483e569 wwe2k14 Session 59 (diagnostic): the segment log's lazy pass barrier line names the command that broke the lazy chain

